  \resources\SystemSettings_Language_Add_Profile_Components_Dialog_SelectedLanguageLabel:
    Candidate Language=KN-IN: ಆಯ್ಕೆಮಾಡಲಾದ ಭಾಷೆ: %1!s!
  \resources\SystemSettings_Language_Add_Profile_Components_Dialog_RequiredFeaturesLabel:
